{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel","level":"A1","topic":"Artikel","title":{"de":"Artikel: der, die, das, ein, eine","bn":"Article: der, die, das, ein, eine"},"summary":"Noun-এর আগে বসা ছোট শব্দ: the-এর মতো der/die/das, a-এর মতো ein/eine।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"জার্মান ভাষায় কোনো জিনিসের নাম বলার আগে অনেক সময় একটি ছোট শব্দ বসে। একে Article বলে।"},{"kind":"text","text":"ইংরেজিতে যেমন:"},{"kind":"list","items":["a book","the book"]},{"kind":"text","text":"জার্মান ভাষায়:"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"ein Buch","bn":"একটি বই"},{"de":"das Buch","bn":"বইটি"}]}],"sections":[{"heading":"১. Definite Article: der, die, das","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"এগুলো ইংরেজির the-এর মতো।"},{"kind":"table","rows":[["Article","ব্যবহার","উদাহরণ"],["der","Masculine","der Mann = পুরুষটি"],["die","Feminine","die Frau = মহিলাটি"],["das","Neuter","das Kind = শিশুটি"],["die","Plural","die Kinder = শিশুরা"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"খুব গুরুত্বপূর্ণ: এখানে Masculine, Feminine ও Neuter বলতে জার্মান ব্যাকরণের শব্দের ধরন বোঝায়। এগুলো সব সময় বাস্তব মানুষের লিঙ্গের সঙ্গে মেলে না।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"der Tisch","bn":"টেবিল"},{"de":"die Tür","bn":"দরজা"},{"de":"das Buch","bn":"বই"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"টেবিল পুরুষ নয়, দরজা নারী নয়, বইও নিরপেক্ষ ব্যক্তি নয়। এগুলো শুধু ব্যাকরণগত শ্রেণি।"}]},{"heading":"২. Indefinite Article: ein, eine","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"এগুলো ইংরেজির a বা an-এর মতো।"},{"kind":"table","rows":[["Definite","Indefinite","বাংলা"],["der Mann","ein Mann","একজন পুরুষ"],["die Frau","eine Frau","একজন মহিলা"],["das Kind","ein Kind","একটি শিশু"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"মনে রাখবে:"},{"kind":"list","items":["der → ein","die → eine","das → ein"]}]},{"heading":"৩. বাক্যে ব্যবহার","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Das ist ein Buch.","bn":"এটি একটি বই।"},{"de":"Das ist eine Tasche.","bn":"এটি একটি ব্যাগ।"},{"de":"Das ist der Tisch.","bn":"এটি টেবিলটি।"},{"de":"Das ist die Tür.","bn":"এটি দরজাটি।"}]}]},{"heading":"৪. Article শেখার সঠিক পদ্ধতি","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"শুধু Tisch = টেবিল মুখস্থ করবে না।"},{"kind":"text","text":"এভাবে শিখবে:"},{"kind":"list","items":["der Tisch","die Tür","das Buch"]},{"kind":"text","text":"অর্থাৎ, প্রতিটি Noun-এর সঙ্গে Article-ও মুখস্থ করবে।"}]}],"test":[{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Mann (পুরুষটি)","options":["der","die","das"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Mann Masculine, তাই der Mann।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Frau (মহিলাটি)","options":["das","die","der"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Frau Feminine, তাই die Frau।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Kind (শিশুটি)","options":["der","die","das"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Kind Neuter, তাই das Kind।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"„das Buch“ থেকে „একটি বই“ হবে:","options":["eine Buch","ein Buch","der Buch"],"answer":1,"explanation":"das → ein, তাই ein Buch।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das ist ___ Tasche. (এটি একটি ব্যাগ।)","options":["eine","ein","der"],"answer":0,"explanation":"die Tasche, আর die → eine, তাই eine Tasche।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"বহুবচনে (Plural) Definite Article কোনটি?","options":["der","das","die"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Plural-এ সব সময় die, যেমন die Kinder।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a1-grammar-artikel","level":"A1","test":[{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Mann (পুরুষটি)","options":["der","die","das"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Mann Masculine, তাই der Mann।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Frau (মহিলাটি)","options":["das","die","der"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Frau Feminine, তাই die Frau।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Kind (শিশুটি)","options":["der","die","das"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Kind Neuter, তাই das Kind।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"„das Buch“ থেকে „একটি বই“ হবে:","options":["eine Buch","ein Buch","der Buch"],"answer":1,"explanation":"das → ein, তাই ein Buch।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das ist ___ Tasche. (এটি একটি ব্যাগ।)","options":["eine","ein","der"],"answer":0,"explanation":"die Tasche, আর die → eine, তাই eine Tasche।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-artikel-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"বহুবচনে (Plural) Definite Article কোনটি?","options":["der","das","die"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Plural-এ সব সময় die, যেমন die Kinder।"}]}